# Boss test (#97): maps/bosstest.vmap, skill 2. Woofu faces the player
# start and wakes on tic 0. The player picks up the supplies on the start
# row (fans fly meanwhile), then `clear` fights with the Scarab Launcher;
# when the scarabs run out the weapon auto-switches to the Eye of Ra Lance.
# Woofu flinches into phase 2 at HP 1200 (lid_blast), the first pods open at
# 700 awake tics and their 4 Chompers die in the clear too. 105 tics after
# Woofu dies its tag 1 opens the switch-mode door in the north wall (no other
# way to open it); the player walks through and uses the EXIT wall behind.
# Ends with kills=5/5 (Woofu + 4 pod Chompers) and exit=1.
vsdemo 1
level 8
skill 2
seed 0
map bosstest

expect kills=0
goto 7 1                # Golden Sardine
goto 8 1                # Sun Shard
goto 9 1                # Scarab Plate
goto 10 1               # Eye of Ra Lance
goto 12 1               # Scarab Launcher
goto 13 1               # Scarab crate
goto 14 1               # Golden Sardine
goto 11 2
weapon 5
face 11 12
clear 20 6000
expect health>0
wait 170
goto 11 18
face 90
use
expect exit=1
